Here is the interactive UI representing the filterable task queue. It utilizes a two-column dashboard layout with filter controls on the left and a detailed sortable task registry on the right.

### Step 1: Initialize the Surface
First, we instantiate a new interface surface.

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9.1",
  "createSurface": {
    "surfaceId": "task-manager-surface",
    "catalogId": "https://a2uicatalog.ai/catalog/c-data-display.json"
  }
}
</a2ui-json>

### Step 2: Render the Components
Next, we populate the interface with our filter layout, status selector, and the registry of eight distinct items.

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9.1",
  "updateComponents": {
    "surfaceId": "task-manager-surface",
    "components": [
      {
        "id": "root",
        "component": "columns",
        "cols": 2,
        "gap": "2rem",
        "align": "top",
        "items": [
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "left-heading",
                "component": "heading",
                "text": "Operational Task Queue"
              },
              {
                "id": "left-body",
                "component": "body",
                "text": "Monitor ongoing engineering tasks and deployment milestones. Select a status filter below to refine the visible task list."
              },
              {
                "id": "status-filter",
                "component": "segmented_control",
                "name": "status_filter",
                "options": "[{\"label\": \"All (8)\", \"value\": \"all\"}, {\"label\": \"Active (3)\", \"value\": \"active\"}, {\"label\": \"Pending (3)\", \"value\": \"pending\"}, {\"label\": \"Completed (2)\", \"value\": \"completed\"}]",
                "selected_value": "all"
              },
              {
                "id": "summary-metrics",
                "component": "metric_row",
                "cols": 2,
                "metrics": [
                  {
                    "value": "37.5%",
                    "label": "Completion Rate",
                    "trend": "up"
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "3 Active",
                    "label": "In Progress"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "right-table",
                "component": "data_table_sortable",
                "headers": [
                  "Task / Title",
                  "One-Line Detail",
                  "Status"
                ],
                "rows": [
                  [
                    "Database Migration",
                    "Migrate legacy user records to PostgreSQL",
                    "Active"
                  ],
                  [
                    "API Integration",
                    "Connect Stripe billing webhooks and checkout flow",
                    "Active"
                  ],
                  [
                    "Security Audit",
                    "Review IAM permissions and access control lists",
                    "Pending"
                  ],
                  [
                    "UI Redesign",
                    "Refactor core dashboard layouts to CSS Grid",
                    "Completed"
                  ],
                  [
                    "Load Testing",
                    "Simulate 10k concurrent WebSocket connections",
                    "Pending"
                  ],
                  [
                    "Documentation",
                    "Update developer onboarding setup guides",
                    "Completed"
                  ],
                  [
                    "SSL Certificate Renewal",
                    "Rotate wildcard certificates for staging domains",
                    "Active"
                  ],
                  [
                    "Analytics Setup",
                    "Configure Mixpanel event tracking for signup funnels",
                    "Pending"
                  ]
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
</a2ui-json>
